  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Landscapes Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia has vast land potential with exceptional diversity of landscapes and climate, an abundance of water and richness of natural resources has prioritized agriculture as a sector of strategic importance in Colombia&#x2019;s post-conflict development plans. The strategic priorities are as follows: 1.Advancing a public private sector policy dialogue in both the targeted commodities and towards landscapes level approaches within the framework of the Colombia Partnership; 2.Improvements of income and sustainable practices for actors in the targeted commodities with better access to technical assistance, certification, markets and finance tools; 3.Demonstrate effective Landscape level approaches that deliver in vulnerable regions sustainable growth in agricultural production, protect the natural resources and include the producer communities and other stakeholders,</narrative>
  </description>
